  "description": "Burmage\u00e7it, Tunceli ((Kurdish: \u015eixso)) is a modern Turkish settlement in the Tunceli province in eastern Turkey. Here was a tomb in which several Urartian metal objects have been found. Among them was a bronze helmet with a note of ownership (CTU B 5-8) of the Urartian king Minua (9th / 8th century BCE).",
